1
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:43,880
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">really stole the diamond?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

2
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:46,400
<font color="#ffffff">Go find some proof.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">Find what made you curious</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">and eager to find the truth.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">Then I'll help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,240
<font color="#ffffff">Is this my house?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:01,840
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't you want to learn more</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">about yourself?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

9
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,600
<font color="#ffffff">This is the best way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:05,720
<font color="#ffffff">This woman is Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">She's a former cop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:11,240
<font color="#ffffff">Is this who you really are?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

13
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,320
<font color="#ffffff">-Jealous?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Not that much, boss.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

14
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">After all, work is more important.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,360
<font color="#ffffff">What is this place?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,240
<font color="#ffffff">A private detective agency.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">So why did you take me here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

18
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,720
<font color="#ffffff">Here's your drink.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,080
<font color="#ffffff">Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,040
<font color="#ffffff">"Areena Patimakorn."</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,040
<font color="#ffffff">"Private Detective."</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,120
<font color="#ffffff">Would it kill you to listen to me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,920
<font color="#ffffff">Just say what you want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,240
<font color="#ffffff">Everything that happened in the forest…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,120
<font color="#ffffff">It was just a coincidence.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:42,120
<font color="#ffffff">Chan doesn't believe you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:53,960
<font color="#ffffff">CHATCHAWAN</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">PRIVATE DETECTIVE AGENCY<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

28
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,880
<font color="#ffffff">Did Captain Chansuek believe you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,280
<font color="#ffffff">It's up to him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">if he believes me or not, Dad.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

30
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,400
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:29,600
<font color="#ffffff">Well, didn't you tell me to change</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">my approach to the investigation?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

32
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,480
<font color="#ffffff">I don't have to go with him now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">You're right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:39,280
<font color="#ffffff">We need to focus on Ms. Yok</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

35
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">Are you okay right now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm okay, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">Why wouldn't I be?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">It's a good thing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:04:58,160 --> 00:05:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">I don't have to hide anything now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's actually a relief.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,160
<font color="#ffffff">Da, please pull over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">I know how you feel, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:40,080
<font color="#ffffff">Nobody likes being made a fool of.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,760
<font color="#ffffff">That woman is nasty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">She used you to benefit her own career.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:56,040
<font color="#ffffff">If you need anything from me,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just let me know.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

47
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">If it gives you peace of mind,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,400
<font color="#ffffff">I'll do anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,360
<font color="#ffffff">Please just…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,480
<font color="#ffffff">drop me off here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,600
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">Let me off here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,080
<font color="#ffffff">You can head home.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,240
<font color="#ffffff">Why, Chan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let me take you to the temple.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:32,920
<font color="#ffffff">Or you can stay at my place</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">until you calm down.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

57
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">I want to be alone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,880
<font color="#ffffff">Fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:45,280
<font color="#ffffff">I'll see you when you feel better.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,200
<font color="#ffffff">Goodbye.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey! A ghost!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What? I'm no ghost.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

62
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not! You…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

63
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:54,120
<font color="#ffffff">What brings you this deep into the forest?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:56,840
<font color="#ffffff">-I came here to photograph butterflies.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

66
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:59,280
<font color="#ffffff">I'm an entomologist.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:04,120
<font color="#ffffff">That's why I came here to study insects</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the northern forest region.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

68
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">What if I really am a thief</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,120
<font color="#ffffff">who stole the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:41,919
<font color="#ffffff">Nobody knows.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:44,280
<font color="#ffffff">Unless you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:48,440
<font color="#ffffff">turn yourself in to a trustworthy cop</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,280
<font color="#ffffff">and let them investigate.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:53,480
<font color="#ffffff">But I don't have a single memory</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:55,000
<font color="#ffffff">left in my head.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">Right now, I have two fond memories.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:59,760
<font color="#ffffff">What are they?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:02,720
<font color="#ffffff">One is of Luang Pho Suea…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,360
<font color="#ffffff">The other…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,760
<font color="#ffffff">is of you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,400
<font color="#ffffff">We're almost there!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:23,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,920
<font color="#ffffff">You know where I live.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,040
<font color="#ffffff">You know my history.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:40,960
<font color="#ffffff">And you ran into my grandma.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

86
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:47,840
<font color="#ffffff">It feels like you were investigating me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">Are you crazy?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">I saw your grandma by chance.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">Your address and background.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,680
<font color="#ffffff">I found out about it in Bangkok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,480
<font color="#ffffff">You're a detective?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:07,760
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:13,000
<font color="#ffffff">Everything that happened in the forest</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,880
<font color="#ffffff">was an accident.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:17,120
<font color="#ffffff">It was just a coincidence.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">You've been lying the whole time?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,640
<font color="#ffffff">All this time,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

98
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,040
<font color="#ffffff">which part was real?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,080
<font color="#ffffff">You think you're so tough, huh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,840
<font color="#ffffff">How did I do that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">-I saw it.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-That was awesome.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

102
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,320
<font color="#ffffff">-How was that?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Stop bragging. Let's go!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

103
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,320
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Quick.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

104
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go. Thanks.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

105
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">What diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,920
<font color="#ffffff">If you won't give it to me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,440
<font color="#ffffff">then you will all die here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:39,360
<font color="#ffffff">-Then I'll start with her.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-No, don't!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

109
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">If you're going to shoot, shoot me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,920
<font color="#ffffff">Wait! Hold on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">I want to see you off too, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:12,600
<font color="#ffffff">But I don't think that's…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:17,000
<font color="#ffffff">If you don't stand by the one</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you love when they're in trouble,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

114
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">how could you call that love?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,800
<font color="#ffffff">How can we believe a word you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:27,000
<font color="#ffffff">You don't have to.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:30,160
<font color="#ffffff">I only want to protect the man I love.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,320
<font color="#ffffff">This is for the best.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,600
<font color="#ffffff">After all,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:51,200
<font color="#ffffff">you and I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,840
<font color="#ffffff">We're never meant to be.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:18,000
<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you wake Junior up?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">You could use some help</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">carrying your stuff.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

124
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,000
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">I saw how long it took your Junior</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to fall asleep.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

126
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,480
<font color="#ffffff">It was already dawn.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,720
<font color="#ffffff">Let him get some rest. I'm fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:35,280
<font color="#ffffff">Is there any monk more compassionate</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">than you, Luang Pho Suea?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

129
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,200
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, how sweet of you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:40,960
<font color="#ffffff">-Good morning, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Blessings, sir.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

131
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:45,880
<font color="#ffffff">Sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,640
<font color="#ffffff">Sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:49,640
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,360
<font color="#ffffff">Sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">Are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">Sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:56,800
<font color="#ffffff">Help!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,200
<font color="#ffffff">Somebody, help!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,000
<font color="#ffffff">Sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:05,440
<font color="#ffffff">CHATCHAWAN</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">PRIVATE DETECTIVE AGENCY<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

141
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going to follow Ms. Yok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:23,600
<font color="#ffffff">I think we can get some leads.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:25,480
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure you're okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">I'll do it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,320
<font color="#ffffff">Why would I not be okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:32,240
<font color="#ffffff">I survived the forest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">I have no fear.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

151
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:35,080
<font color="#ffffff">Goodbye.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:57,960
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:59,240
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">-You're here for me?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-That's right. We have to go.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

155
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">Go where?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,880
<font color="#ffffff">Come with me. You'll find out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">Ya, where are we going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,080
<font color="#ffffff">-You'll see. Come on.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Wait…<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

159
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,880
<font color="#ffffff">Is that man going to be okay, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:25,520
<font color="#ffffff">Sir, how are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">He has heart disease.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">That's why he collapsed.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

164
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">He'll be hospitalized</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to monitor his condition.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

165
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:37,920
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much, Luang Pho,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for taking me to the hospital.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

166
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:42,800
<font color="#ffffff">You're welcome.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">So what are you going to do?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

167
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,520
<font color="#ffffff">Have you called your family?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:49,760
<font color="#ffffff">Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">Are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

171
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm fine now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,800
<font color="#ffffff">I was lucky Luang Pho was there to help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:12,240
<font color="#ffffff">Quick! Luang Pho. Come on.</font><font color="#ffffff">
