<font color="#ffffff">If you let go and forgive,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:11,320
<font color="#ffffff">everything will feel light,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:14,040
<font color="#ffffff">and you will truly be free.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">Wisdom comes from calmness, Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,720
<font color="#ffffff">Are you mad at him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:04,120
<font color="#ffffff">He won't hear me out, Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:32:05,040 --> 00:32:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just doing my job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:32:07,840 --> 00:32:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't mean to deceive anyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:13,000
<font color="#ffffff">Sometimes, doing your job</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:32:13,080 --> 00:32:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">can break your heart, you know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod may be angry at you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">but I think his anger</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">comes from a place of sadness.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

354
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:29,160
<font color="#ffffff">You've become a part of his life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:32:29,240 --> 00:32:31,360
<font color="#ffffff">You made him trust you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">But in the end,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

357
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:35,440
<font color="#ffffff">none of it was real.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:38,800
<font color="#ffffff">He just can't deal with that feeling.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

359
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:41,000
<font color="#ffffff">Just like you right now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:32:51,320 --> 00:32:54,600
<font color="#ffffff">So now, what should I do, Ya?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:32:56,680 --> 00:32:59,160
<font color="#ffffff">If you know you're wrong,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:04,880
<font color="#ffffff">there's no shame</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in being the first to apologize.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

363
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:09,840
<font color="#ffffff">Those who can admit they're wrong</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">are the strongest.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

364
00:33:20,080 --> 00:33:21,240
<font color="#ffffff">So…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

365
00:33:22,680 --> 00:33:24,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'll try to talk to him again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">Are you protecting Deputy Papon,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">your boss?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

367
00:33:51,600 --> 00:33:54,560
<font color="#ffffff">How am I protecting him?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just analyzing facts.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

368
00:33:54,640 --> 00:33:55,800
<font color="#ffffff">What about me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:33:55,880 --> 00:33:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you better than me? You liar.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

370
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, so it's all about you, huh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

371
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:03,280
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

372
00:34:03,360 --> 00:34:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">Are you that upset with me?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Just let it out.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

373
00:34:06,120 --> 00:34:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, you two. What are you arguing about?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:34:09,520 --> 00:34:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:34:11,560 --> 00:34:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm a private detective</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:34:14,080 --> 00:34:16,639
<font color="#ffffff">hired by Ms. Yok's diamond insurer…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:18,520
<font color="#ffffff">to investigate this case.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:34:19,679 --> 00:34:20,960
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:23,920
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want this woman here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:34:26,080 --> 00:34:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">Stay away from us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:29,800
<font color="#ffffff">Will you just calm down?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:34:29,880 --> 00:34:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">Noona was just doing her job.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You don't have to go that far.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

383
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:41,000
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Rage is like a fire.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:34:41,719 --> 00:34:45,159
<font color="#ffffff"><i>It burns your heart before anyone else's.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

385
00:34:49,600 --> 00:34:51,080
<font color="#ffffff">He's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:35:21,640 --> 00:35:22,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:35:32,520 --> 00:35:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">I understand it's hard to forgive me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:35:35,640 --> 00:35:37,680
<font color="#ffffff">I don't blame you for being upset.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:35:39,080 --> 00:35:40,960
<font color="#ffffff">I know you're angry…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

390
00:35:42,160 --> 00:35:43,760
<font color="#ffffff">because you're sad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:35:47,640 --> 00:35:51,480
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't come into your life</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to deceive you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

392
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">For everything I did,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:35:59,600 --> 00:36:00,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'm truly sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:36:06,560 --> 00:36:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">You came to me for your job, but I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

395
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:13,080
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't open up to you for my job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:16,600
<font color="#ffffff">I just want to let you know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:36:17,680 --> 00:36:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">that I never pretended</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">when I was with you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

398
00:36:27,280 --> 00:36:29,160
<font color="#ffffff">Someone who lied in the first place</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:36:29,240 --> 00:36:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">isn't really sorry, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:36:34,120 --> 00:36:35,200
<font color="#ffffff">Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">This woman just feels bad</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">because she got caught.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

402
00:36:38,680 --> 00:36:40,120
<font color="#ffffff">She doesn't regret it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

403
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:47,120
<font color="#ffffff">Don't fall for her trick again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:53,960
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon is closely linked to Ms. Yok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:37:40,200 --> 00:37:41,960
<font color="#ffffff">They're not just closely linked.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

407
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:44,200
<font color="#ffffff">Look at this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:38:06,520 --> 00:38:07,760
<font color="#ffffff">See?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:10,120
<font color="#ffffff">It's more like they're intimate.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:15,040
<font color="#ffffff">You're suspecting…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:18,520
<font color="#ffffff">that the heist was staged.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:38:19,440 --> 00:38:20,520
<font color="#ffffff">I am.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

413
00:38:23,080 --> 00:38:25,320
<font color="#ffffff">So what about Captain Chansuek?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,280
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know about that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:33,080
<font color="#ffffff">I bet he doesn't know either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:38:34,600 --> 00:38:36,040
<font color="#ffffff">He has amnesia.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:38:36,120 --> 00:38:37,840
<font color="#ffffff">Does he really?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">I think he really does.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea seems convinced.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">You still have the same faith</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in Luang Pho that you had<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

421
00:38:45,880 --> 00:38:47,480
<font color="#ffffff">when he was Sergeant Padej.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

422
00:38:48,920 --> 00:38:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">Don't start a fight.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

424
00:38:55,200 --> 00:38:56,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'll help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

425
00:38:59,080 --> 00:39:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">It's been a while</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">since I last saw that smile.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

427
00:39:09,560 --> 00:39:11,360
<font color="#ffffff">So what are you going to do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:29,600
<font color="#ffffff">Come in, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:39:32,280 --> 00:39:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:39:35,640 --> 00:39:37,360
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you take me here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

431
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:43,440
<font color="#ffffff">I noticed you were upset,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">so I thought you could use an escape.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

432
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">I want you to really relax for once, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:39:49,800 --> 00:39:50,800
<font color="#ffffff">Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:39:56,720 --> 00:40:00,960
<font color="#ffffff">Let my place be your safe place,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just like before.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

435
00:40:01,040 --> 00:40:02,040
<font color="#ffffff">Is that okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:06,800
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much, Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

437
00:40:32,920 --> 00:40:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">Drink and forget your troubles, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:40:38,800 --> 00:40:41,600
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you so good to me, Da?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:40:48,960 --> 00:40:50,680
<font color="#ffffff">We're in love.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:40:57,520 --> 00:40:59,080
<font color="#ffffff">Love?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:02,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:41:03,440 --> 00:41:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">Love.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:41:44,560 --> 00:41:46,640
<font color="#ffffff">I love you, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:48,960
<font color="#ffffff">Well, Da…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

445
00:41:50,080 --> 00:41:52,680
<font color="#ffffff">I appreciate your feelings.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:41:53,440 --> 00:41:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">But I can't return them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

447
00:41:58,720 --> 00:42:01,600
<font color="#ffffff">We should stay friends.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:42:03,240 --> 00:42:05,200
<font color="#ffffff">Why, Chan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

449
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong with me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

450
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:08,640
<font color="#ffffff">Why can't you love me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

451
00:42:10,200 --> 00:42:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">Nothing is wrong with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

452
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:13,760
<font color="#ffffff">You're a perfect woman.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">But love and feelings…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

454
00:42:19,600 --> 00:42:20,600
<font color="#ffffff">They can't be forced.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:29,040
<font color="#ffffff">You're so mean, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:42:30,080 --> 00:42:34,280
<font color="#ffffff">I took a risk and brought you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">into Kamnan Sawaeng's gang.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

457
00:42:38,680 --> 00:42:41,040
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure you won't change your mind?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:42:42,360 --> 00:42:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">I know your secret.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:45,640
<font color="#ffffff">Did you forget?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:42:50,240 --> 00:42:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">Are you threatening me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

461
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:55,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just warning you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">For a woman like me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

463
00:42:58,280 --> 00:43:01,000
<font color="#ffffff">there's nothing worse than rejection.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:43:03,480 --> 00:43:08,120
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">what my anger might make me do.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

465
00:43:18,120 --> 00:43:19,280
<font color="#ffffff">So be it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:43:19,360 --> 00:43:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">You can do anything you want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

467
00:43:24,440 --> 00:43:27,080
<font color="#ffffff">What I hate the most…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:43:35,480 --> 00:43:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">is being forced.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

469
00:44:12,880 --> 00:44:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong, Chan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

470
00:44:18,960 --> 00:44:20,200
<font color="#ffffff">Are we really in love?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:44:22,800 --> 00:44:24,640
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you asking me that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:44:27,480 --> 00:44:29,160
<font color="#ffffff">Why…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:44:29,240 --> 00:44:31,400
<font color="#ffffff">don't I have any feelings for you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

474
00:44:32,560 --> 00:44:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

475
00:44:34,400 --> 00:44:36,720
<font color="#ffffff">It's because you have amnesia.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:44:38,120 --> 00:44:42,360
<font color="#ffffff">So you don't remember</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">how much we loved each other.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

477
00:44:43,840 --> 00:44:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:44:48,680 --> 00:44:51,080
<font color="#ffffff">You told me Noona deceived me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:44:52,400 --> 00:44:54,080
<font color="#ffffff">So how are you any different?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:44:57,160 --> 00:44:58,360
<font color="#ffffff">You…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:44:59,760 --> 00:45:01,600
<font color="#ffffff">remember now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:45:05,120 --> 00:45:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">It just came back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:45:07,760 --> 00:45:09,440
<font color="#ffffff">I don't remember all of it,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:45:11,840 --> 00:45:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">but I remember my own feelings.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

485
00:45:17,320 --> 00:45:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">Whether in the past or now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:45:23,640 --> 00:45:25,480
<font color="#ffffff">my feelings haven't changed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

487
00:45:35,440 --> 00:45:37,920
<font color="#ffffff">I really appreciate your care for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:45:38,680 --> 00:45:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">You tried to find me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

489
00:45:40,280 --> 00:45:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">You tried to save me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

490
00:45:42,960 --> 00:45:43,960
<font color="#ffffff">But, Da…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

491
00:45:47,680 --> 00:45:49,040
<font color="#ffffff">I don't love you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

492
00:45:53,640 --> 00:45:54,840
<font color="#ffffff">Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:45:55,600 --> 00:45:56,880
<font color="#ffffff">Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

494
00:45:59,680 --> 00:46:00,680
<font color="#ffffff">Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

495
00:46:02,840 --> 00:46:04,840
<font color="#ffffff">Please don't do this, Da.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:46:06,440 --> 00:46:08,440
<font color="#ffffff">What you're doing</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

497
00:46:08,520 --> 00:46:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">isn't just disrespecting me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:46:11,320 --> 00:46:13,280
<font color="#ffffff">You're also fooling yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

499
00:46:15,760 --> 00:46:20,240
<font color="#ffffff">Are you really happy doing this, huh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:46:59,000 --> 00:47:01,280
<font color="#ffffff"><i>You never looked at me.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:47:01,360 --> 00:47:03,320
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Why not, Chan?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

502
00:47:03,400 --> 00:47:04,920
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Why not?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

503
00:47:08,040 --> 00:47:09,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's because of her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

504
00:47:09,720 --> 00:47:10,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sure it is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

505
00:47:24,560 --> 00:47:25,800
<font color="#ffffff">Hello.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

506
00:47:25,880 --> 00:47:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">It's Darat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

507
00:47:27,640 --> 00:47:29,160
<font color="#ffffff">I have a job for you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

508
00:47:33,440 --> 00:47:37,000
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

509
00:47:39,920 --> 00:47:42,120
<font color="#ffffff">I want you to secretly keep an eye on him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

510
00:47:42,200 --> 00:47:43,440
<font color="#ffffff">Don't let anyone notice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

511
00:47:45,560 --> 00:47:47,880
<font color="#ffffff">Noona? Wake up, Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

512
00:47:48,520 --> 00:47:50,280
<font color="#ffffff">Is Noona already dead?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

513
00:47:51,160 --> 00:47:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

514
00:47:52,600 --> 00:47:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

515
00:47:54,200 --> 00:47:56,080
<font color="#ffffff">You should stay away from him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

516
00:47:57,200 --> 00:47:59,040
<font color="#ffffff">He'll only bring you trouble, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

517
00:48:01,520 --> 00:48:03,960
<font color="#ffffff">Why wouldn't I have the nerve to call you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

518
00:48:05,200 --> 00:48:07,440
<font color="#ffffff">You still want to know about the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

519
00:48:08,040 --> 00:48:10,200
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

520
00:48:10,280 --> 00:48:13,320
